  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_034 (0.5988 accuracy) is the best so far with multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, vit_l image, transformer aggregation, and concat fusion. This experiment tests replacing pca_n2000 RNA with scgpt (a more sophisticated encoder) and switching fusion from concat to weighted, which could improve performance. It balances exploration (testing new RNA encoder and fusion) while building on the successful transformer aggregation from config_034. This clarifies whether scgpt and weighted fusion can further enhance accuracy, leveraging the strong foundation of transformer aggregation."  
}

